    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-wb2api-ui",
      "text": "[中文](README.md) | English\n\nA DeepSeek Harness (dsh) plugin that turns your local WorkBuddy / CodeBuddy account pool into a local model gateway and registers it as a dsh LLM provider — pick the models directly inside dsh, with a settings panel for accounts and credits."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Pick one. **Restart dsh after installing** (the host side only loads plugins at startup). This plugin is not published to any plugin marketplace — install it directly using one of the two ways below."
    },
    {
      "section": "Option 1: Desktop UI",
      "text": "Desktop app → Settings → Plugins → **Add Plugin**, enter:\n\n```\nhttps://github.com/Wei894348/dsh-wb2api\n```\n\nA local directory path or a `.tgz` tarball path (from `npm pack`) also works. This is the only way to install into the `desktop` profile (CLI cannot touch it)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Option 2: Command line",
      "text": "```powershell\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:Wei894348/dsh-wb2api\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Uninstall",
      "text": "- **Desktop**: Settings → Plugins → find this plugin → Uninstall\n- **CLI**: `dsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-plugin-wb2api-ui`\n\nRestart dsh afterwards. The runtime directory `%USERPROFILE%\\.dsh\\wb2api\\` (account pool and config) is not removed by uninstall — delete it manually if you want a full cleanup."
    },
